OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency services search river
OL,4,Afor person
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn area of Cambridge has been cordoned
OL,7,Foff while emergency services respond to
OL,8,Freports of a person in a river.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled at about 06:00 BST to the area
OL,12,Faround Stourbridge Common.
OL,14,FA force spokesperson said: "Searches
OL,15,F[and] inquiries are ongoing and likely
OL,16,Fto continue throughout the morning."
OL,18,FPolice urged members of the public to
OL,19,Favoid the Abbey Chesterton and Green
OL,20,FDragon footbridges.
